  # DocumentsService.SchedulesPdf

  `/ltedu.documents.v1.DocumentsService/SchedulesPdf` · unary · `ltedu/documents/v1/documents.proto`

  ## Request — `SchedulesPdfRequest`

  The preview of the timetables as they are now (crossed VISTA PREVIA, without codes)

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `period_id` | `string` |  |
  | `mode` | `string` | section \| grade \| teacher \| general |
  | `target_id` | `string` | A section, grade or staff id; empty: all of them |

